**Table of Contents**

**1. Purpose & Design Philosophy**

This document is the brief for the UI/UX design phase. It specifies
every screen that must be designed, the content and functionality each
screen must contain, the navigation architecture, and the design system
foundations. It is the handoff document from Product to Design and from
Design to Engineering.

**1.1 Design Principles**

  -----------------------------------------------------------------------
  **Principle**    **What It Means in Practice**
  ---------------- ------------------------------------------------------
  Field-first      The most important users are foremen and field techs
                   using the app in direct sunlight, with gloves on, on a
                   6-inch phone. Every UI decision must pass the field
                   test: can it be used one-handed, in bright sun, by
                   someone wearing gloves?

  Density for      Desktop web views can be information-dense --- PMs
  office, space    want to see a lot at once. Mobile views must be large
  for field        touch targets, high contrast, and minimal cognitive
                   load.

  Progressive      Show the most critical information first. Users should
  disclosure       never be overwhelmed on first view. Drill down for
                   detail, not the reverse.

  Zero training    A foreman who has never used the platform should be
  required         able to clock in, complete a task, and submit a daily
                   report without any training. Core field flows must be
                   self-evident.

  Construction     Use the words construction professionals use. Not
  vocabulary       \'tasks\' --- \'work items\'. Not \'vendors\' ---
                   \'subcontractors\' or \'subs\'. Not \'events\' ---
                   \'inspections\', \'daily reports\'. Language matters.

  Earn trust with  Financial data, inspection records, and signed
  data accuracy    documents must feel rock solid. Dense, tight, precise
                   --- not casual or playful. This is someone\'s business
                   and livelihood.

  Speed over       Fast load times and responsive interactions beat
  beauty           pixel-perfect aesthetics. A slow beautiful app will be
                   abandoned. A fast useful one will be forgiven
                   aesthetic imperfections.
  -----------------------------------------------------------------------

**1.2 Design System Foundations**

  -----------------------------------------------------------------------
  **Element**     **Specification**
  --------------- -------------------------------------------------------
  Primary color   #1F4E79 --- deep navy blue. Used for primary actions,
                  headers, navigation.

  Accent color    #2E75B6 --- medium blue. Used for links, secondary
                  actions, section headers.

  Success         #375623 / #E2EFDA --- dark green / light green bg.
                  Passed inspections, completed tasks, active status.

  Warning         #7F6000 / #FFF2CC --- amber / light yellow bg. Pending
                  approvals, expiring items, in-progress status.

  Danger          #843C0C / #FCE4D6 --- dark orange / light orange bg.
                  Failed inspections, overdue items, rejected status.

  Neutral         #333333 body text, #666666 secondary text, #F2F2F2
                  background, #CCCCCC borders.

  Typography      Primary: Inter or system-ui. Monospace: JetBrains Mono
                  or Courier New for codes/IDs. No more than 3 font
                  weights.

  Border radius   4px --- functional, not playful. Avoid pill-shaped
                  buttons except for status badges.

  Spacing system  8px base unit. 8, 16, 24, 32, 48, 64px increments only.

  Icon library    Lucide Icons --- construction-appropriate subset.
                  Supplement with custom trade icons where needed.

  Touch targets   Minimum 44×44px for all interactive elements on mobile.

  Shadow          Single shadow level for cards: 0 1px 3px
                  rgba(0,0,0,0.12). No complex layered shadows.
  -----------------------------------------------------------------------

