**5.1 Gantt Interaction Specs**

-   Drag task bar to reschedule --- triggers dependency recalculation
    cascade

-   Click task row to open task detail side panel (not a new page ---
    panel slides in from right)

-   Task detail panel: name, dates, assignee, trade, % complete slider,
    status, notes, linked inspection

-   Critical path tasks highlighted in amber --- hover tooltip explains
    why it\'s critical

-   Baseline overlay: faint bar behind current bar shows original
    planned dates when baseline exists

-   Zoom controls: Day / Week / Month / Quarter --- default to Month
    view

-   Print to PDF: generates a clean A3/tabloid-format Gantt for site
    posting

-   Two-week lookahead button: filters to tasks active in next 14 days
    --- quick foreman view

