**8. Document & Plan Screens**

**8.1 Plan Viewer**

The plan viewer is a critical differentiator --- field teams need to
view large plan PDFs quickly on any device. The viewer must support:

-   PDF rendering in-browser --- no download required

-   Pan and zoom --- pinch-to-zoom on mobile, scroll wheel on desktop

-   Revision selector --- dropdown to switch between plan revisions

-   Page thumbnail strip --- navigate between sheets

-   Offline caching --- downloaded plans available without connectivity
    (mobile)

-   RFI pin overlay --- optional: show RFI markers on the plan at their
    referenced location

